            "description": "Closes the trade, computes realizedPnl and realizedPnlPct. exitReason must be one of: TARGET1 | TARGET2 | STOP_LOSS | MANUAL | TRAILING_SL | EARNINGS_EXIT. TARGET2 also sends a T2 congratulations alert."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /api/trades/:id/close — stopped out",
          "request": {
